            "review_title": "Review at Sky Garden",
            "review_text": "Bobbie C\n8 contributions\n0\nVery interesting cafe\nDec 2022 • Family\nVery friendly and attentive staff. I suggest sitting on the first floor to get the most out of the \"floating\" ambience. There are many koi fish in a pond on the first floor. There are three floors total. \n\nThe drink variety is good with both non-alcoholic and some alcoholic beverages. There are limited beers, but they have a page of commonly seen cocktails. Food is mostly of the finger food snack variety except pizza. There's a ball pit for children also. \n\nI highly recommend this place for the relaxed atmosphere and inexpensive drinks. No drink costs more than 2 USD, except the cocktails.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2022",
